-In 睡眠, 睡 supplies スイ and 眠 supplies ミン. In 熟睡, 熟 supplies ジュク and 睡 supplies スイ; in 午睡, 午 supplies ゴ and 睡 supplies スイ. 昏睡, "coma" and "deep sleep; falling fast asleep," is not aligned to per-kanji readings in the repo's alignment. For the kun readings, JMdict lists 眠る ねむる as the main spelling, with 睡る as another written form of it. JMdict also lists 眠い ねむい with 睡い as another written form, and 眠り ねむり, "sleep; sleeping," with 睡り as a "rarely used kanji form." The ordinary writing is with 眠, so these 睡 spellings are not the forms to learn first.
